/-- **PROVED (CLAIM-C4-3) — THE BAND CLOSURE, premise-free, new this
cycle:** `|U| ≤ 2p−3 ⟹ D ≤ 0`. No G2 condition, no G1 condition, no
crossing-index input, no external premise — the shadow layer at
`j := p−2` alone. This is the exact regime the allocation names ("where
`Δ_{p−2}(U)` lands at or just above zero with small slack"): on this band
the slack requirement `D ≤ H−1` is met with room to spare (`H ≥ 1`), owing
